<!--
  The editable-regions editing style; index.md covers Bookshop. data-prop binds
  each region to a frontmatter prop, data-rosey hands it to RCC.

  data-editable="source" puts the key in RCC's originalIsSource set, giving the
  clone the content toolbar. data-type="block" is required on it — without one
  the entry reads as perpetually stale and won't open an editor.
-->
<h1 data-editable="text" data-prop="heading" data-rosey="heading">{{ heading }}</h1>
<div data-editable="source" data-prop="body" data-rosey="body" data-type="block">{{ body }}</div>
<p>Sibling with no data-rosey — must stay uneditable.</p>
